+-- passage. A white-gold line lies on the floor and runs on toward the arch's
+-- far side, gold motes rise off it as from a sunbeam, a pale sky-blue haze
+-- drifts over it (the area's one cool note), and a few warm lights pool on
+-- the floor and the piers. Three seeds bend the path differently, so the
+-- light finds a different way through. Kept low: the motes rise a few studs,
+-- never into the game camera (SE10).
+recipes.domain_arch_light = {
